==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|ang|Dofras}}, from {{der|en|la|Dubris}}, from {{der|en|cel-bry|-}} {{m|bry|Dubras||the waters}}, from {{der|en|cel-pro|*dubros||water}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*dʰubrós||dark}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*dʰewb-||deep}}. Compare {{m|en|Tauber}}.

The village in Nova Scotia is likely named after the town in England.

